{ The first kind of rosette is an alternating rosette, in which the colors alternate as you go around the circle of pieces. With white to move, all alternating rosettes are trivial wins for white. }
1. Qc5+ (1. Qe5+ Kd2 2. Qxd6+) 1... Kd2 2. Qxd6+ *


